    "long_instructions": "# Sea Level Changes by Year\r\n\r\nBuild on your decade analysis by grouping the sea-level data by year. Use `agg()` to calculate several statistics at once.\r\n\r\n1. Use `groupby()` and `agg()` to calculate the total, average, minimum, and maximum sea-level anomalies for each year.\r\n2. Run the program and examine the results.\r\n3. Discuss which years stand out and what each statistic reveals about the data.\r\n4. Optional: Modify the code to calculate the statistics by decade instead of year.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor for an example of how `groupby()` and `agg()` work together, or ask it to explain the code, output, or documentation. Use its guidance to complete the work yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
